 # Lesson-specific opening, transfer checks and timing.
 recalls=[
  ('Your starting point','Name a task you trust AI with today and a task you would check.','Any concrete example is acceptable; record the reason as a baseline.'),
  ('Recall the distinction','An assistant totals invoices and drafts a letter. Which operation needs learned generation?','The letter uses generation; the total should use defined arithmetic.'),
  ('Recall training and inference','We upload a new clause today. Which learned parameters must change?','None necessarily. The clause can be supplied as inference context.'),
  ('Recall the reliability test','Three assistants repeat the same unsupported fee. What has been established?','Agreement, not the fee; the signed source is still absent.'),
  ('Recall the task brief','The instruction asks for exact quotes. What if the input scan loses a word?','Good instructions cannot recover an unknown missing word reliably; inspect the source.'),
  ('Recall source preparation','Two readable versions exist. What must retrieval know beyond the text?','Which version is authoritative, its matter, permissions and update status.'),
  ('Recall retrieval limits','A retrieved passage has a valid citation. What remains before advice?','Read it, verify authority/version and assess whether it supports the proposition and facts.'),
  ('Recall research discipline','A party argues a fee is not taxable. May the memo label that the court’s finding?','No. Separate the submission from the court’s reasoning and disposition.'),
  ('Recall review responsibility','A draft quotes correctly but names an unauthorised recipient. May it be sent?','No. Content quality and action authority are separate.'),
  ('Recall the action boundary','A human rejects an otherwise accurate draft. What happens next?','The dependent action stops; revise or request a new authorised decision.'),
  ('Recall reconciliation','Do receipts lower than sales establish unpaid tax?','No. Check timing, evidence and the applicable tax question.'),
  ('Recall governance','What evidence would support restarting after restricted-data disclosure?','Containment, cause investigation, corrected controls, passed tests and an authorised restart decision.')]
 checks=[
  ('A new task: deadline reminders',['A fixed date needs a reminder. Would you train a model?','A draft quotes the contract but omits the exception. Is it usable?','Name one source owner for the candidate task.'],'Use a maintained date and rule. The omitted operative exception fails completeness. Identify the actual or proposed matter/source owner.'),
  ('An unseen language example',['Does a token ID near another token ID establish similar meaning?','Why can charge mean security in one sentence and accusation in another?','What changes during training rather than ordinary inference?'],'IDs are identifiers, not a distance metric. Context changes the representation. Training adjusts parameters; ordinary inference uses them.'),
  ('A new missing-source question',['The document never supplies a renewal fee. What should the answer say?','A longer context window includes the clause. Is the conclusion guaranteed?','Three identical responses appear. What is the remaining verification?'],'State the missing fee and request the source. Capacity is not faithful use. Compare the proposition with the authoritative text and facts.'),
  ('Variant A: share sale',['An unrelated buyer acquires control of Equator. Does clause 3’s group exception apply?','The account is paid. May the firm upload any matter?','A prompt requests a citation. What makes it useful?'],'The stipulated share sale is outside the group exception, so prior written customer consent is required. Price does not settle permission. Check the exact passage, authority, version and fit.'),
  ('A changed extraction',['The scan says shall not disclose; extraction says shall disclose. Which stage failed?','The text is accurate but the matter tag is wrong. What risk remains?','Which record preserves correction history?'],'Extraction reversed meaning. Wrong metadata can expose or retrieve the wrong matter. Keep a source-linked quality/correction record and retest derived content.'),
  ('A fresh retrieval result',['The answer uses the right version but invents an ownership fact. Which test fails?','Search finds no current permitted source. What should happen?','Could keyword retrieval be part of a RAG system?'],'Answer fidelity/uncertainty fails. Return a gap or clarification, not an invented answer. RAG can use keyword, vector or hybrid retrieval; it is not defined by vectors alone.'),
  ('A new authority claim',['A later summary contradicts the historical judgment. Which text must be inspected?','Section numbers differ between editions. What must the memo record?','Can the historical holding decide Victoria’s proposed fee?'],'Inspect both actual authorities and later treatment. Record Act, edition/date, provision and proposition. The client’s facts and applicable current law need their own analysis.'),
  ('Variant B: assignment',['Equator proposes assigning the agreement. Does clause 3 alone settle permission?','The company name is extracted. Has its obligation been established?','The signed schedule is absent. May the amendment assume a fee?'],'No: the extract is silent on assignment; inspect the full terms and applicable law. Roles and obligations require surrounding text. Do not invent a fee.'),
  ('A new action request',['The model requests an unapproved lookup. Who stops it?','A field changes after approval. Is the old approval sufficient?','A tool server is connected. Has agentic behaviour been demonstrated?'],'The execution host enforces the allowed tool and arguments. A changed version requires new review. A connection alone proves no model-selected action.'),
  ('A changed period',['One receipt belongs to October rather than September. Does the 18m balance still follow?','A missing reference proves fraud: accept or reject?','Acknowledgement is uncertain. Should the action be repeated immediately?'],'Recalculate under the changed timing. Reject the unsupported fraud claim and request evidence. Inspect actual status and identifiers before retrying.'),
  ('A new governance decision',['No-training is enabled. What other data questions remain?','A scanned collection has more errors. What must be measured?','A restricted passage entered a draft. What is the first response?'],'Check retention, access, contracts, location and permission. Measure relevant group quality and effects, with adequate samples. Contain the affected route and preserve evidence while assessing recipients and duties.'),
  ('A pilot that fails its test',['The draft saves time but loses a critical exception. Expand?','Review effort rises above the manual baseline. What changes?','Who can approve more users or action authority?'],'Do not expand with a critical failure. Revise the design or stop if total effort/value is worse. Named firm authorities decide scope and permissions after additional tests.')]
